## 3. GSAP ScrollTrigger patterns

**Section reveal (scrubbed)** — target elements with class `.reveal-scrub` (or your prefix):

```ts
gsap.utils.toArray<HTMLElement>('.reveal-scrub').forEach((section) => {
  gsap.fromTo(
    section,
    { opacity: 0.8, scale: 0.996 },
    {
      opacity: 1,
      scale: 1,
      ease: 'power2.out',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: section,
        start: 'top 86%',
        end: 'top 50%',
        scrub: true,
      },
    },
  )
})
```

**Light parallax on layers** — class `.parallax-layer`:

```ts
gsap.utils.toArray<HTMLElement>('.parallax-layer').forEach((layer) => {
  gsap.to(layer, {
    yPercent: -4,
    ease: 'none',
    scrollTrigger: {
      trigger: layer,
      start: 'top bottom',
      end: 'bottom top',
      scrub: true,
    },
  })
})
```

Run both inside `useGsapScene(() => { ... })` so ScrollTriggers revert on unmount.

