## 5. CSS companions (optional)

- **Film grain:** `animation: grain-shift 0.22s steps(2) infinite` with tiny `background-position` keyframes.
- **Scroll cue:** subtle vertical bob, `animation: scroll-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite`.
- **Pointer spotlight:** parent sets `--spotlight-x` / `--spotlight-y` from `pointermove`; children use `radial-gradient` using those vars.
- **3D tilt cards:** `transform-style: preserve-3d` + `--rx` / `--ry` from pointer (or static).

---

## 6. Advanced: cursor-driven word push (optional)

`useInteractionEngine`: rAF updates `transform` / `opacity` on word nodes from distance to **object** and optional **cursor** poses. Disable when `reduceMotion`. Pair with a custom cursor overlay if desired.

---

## 7. Reduced motion contract

| System | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Lenis | Off |
| `useGsapScene` | Pass `enabled: false` |
| Horizontal `motion` `x` | Omit |
| Interaction engine / custom cursor | Off |
| WebGL hero | Off or static fallback |

Framer `whileInView` respects user preference by default; you may still gate heavy effects manually.

---

## 8. Sanity checklist

- [ ] `ScrollTrigger` registered once.
- [ ] Lenis `raf` on `gsap.ticker`; `ScrollTrigger.update` on Lenis scroll.
- [ ] GSAP selectors match DOM classes after mount.
- [ ] Sticky + scrub sections have enough scroll distance (`minHeight` vh).
- [ ] Test with OS “reduce motion” on.
